% Issue 19 (checker side): a type definition referencing a type that is not in
% scope (here Response, as when an agent isolate is loaded with an incomplete
% self.glp scope) must be surfaced as a LOCATABLE type diagnostic
% ("Unresolved type: Response" with a line/column), not an unhandled
% UnknownTypeError that escapes and kills the caller.
GsgCargo ::= friend_request(Response?).
procedure handle(GsgCargo?, Constant).
handle(friend_request(_), ok).
